{"sha": "4eb5939903d5d317418e4c2486c3e0f6bc3558688fee7b862167729897f03e7f", "body": ["(c) $\\norm{Tx}^2 = \\sum_ns_n^2\\abs{\\langle e_n, x\\rangle}^2", "\\leq (\\max s_n)^2\\norm x^2$，等号在使其最大的", "$e_n$ 处取得：$\\vertiii T = \\max s_n$。将奇异值分解在秩", "$N$ 处截断，得到范数为 $\\sup_{n>N}s_n \\to 0$ 的算子：", "有限秩逼近。沃尔泰拉算子没有", "特征值（见\\cref{exo:b3:spectral:7}），但 $V^*V$ 有：", "$V^*Vf(x) = \\int_x^1\\int_0^tf(s)\\,\\dd s\\,\\dd t$ 是", "对称正核算子（核为 $1 - \\max(x,y)$，", "弦型格林核），其特征对 --- 借助", "边值问题 $-u'' = \\lambda^{-1}u$，$u'(0)", "= u(1) = 0$（即 \\cref{exo:b3:spectral:9} 的族）算出 ---", "给出奇异值 $s_n = \\bigl((n + \\frac12)\\pi\\bigr)^{-1}$。", "奇异值分解之所以依赖于 \\emph{两组} 标准正交族，", "因为 $V$ 将其特征几何“旋走”：没有特征向量，", "却在两组不同的基之间具有完美的对角结构。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b3:spectral:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 连续性：$\\min$ 与 $\\max$ 连续；", "对称性：交换 $x, y$ 既不改变 $\\min(x,y)$，也不改变 $1 -", "\\max(x,y)$。界：$0 \\leq g$，且 $g(x,y) \\leq", "\\max\\cdot(1-\\max)$ 型的界给出 $g \\leq \\frac14$（对 $u", "= \\max$：$\\min \\leq u$，故 $g \\leq u(1-u) \\leq \\frac14$）。$g", "\\in L^2(\\square)$：是希尔伯特–施密特算子，故 $G$ 紧", "（见\\cref{exo:b3:spectral:4}）；核是实对称的：$G$", "自伴。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 在 $y = x$ 处分段：", "\\[", "u(x) = (1 - x)\\int_0^x y\\,f(y)\\,\\dd y +", "x\\int_x^1(1 - y)\\,f(y)\\,\\dd y .", "\\]", "设 $f$ 连续，对上式求导（用乘积法则与", "微积分基本定理）：", "\\[", "u'(x) = -\\int_0^xyf + \\int_x^1(1-y)f", "\\qquad\\text{（边界项相消）},", "\\]", "且 $u''(x) = -xf(x) - (1 - x)f(x) = -f(x)$；显然 $u(0) =", "u(1) = 0$。反之，若 $u \\in \\mathcal C^2$ 在两端取零，", "则 $w = u - G(-u'')$ 满足 $w'' = 0$，$w(0) = w(1) =", "0$：$w$ 为仿射函数且有两个零点，故 $w = 0$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 设 $Gf = 0$，$f \\in L^2$。对 $\\psi \\in \\mathcal", "C_c^\\infty(\\intoo01)$：由第 2 问 $\\psi = G(-\\psi'')$，于是", "\\[", "\\langle f, \\psi\\rangle = \\langle f, G(-\\psi'')\\rangle", "= \\langle Gf, -\\psi''\\rangle = 0", "\\]", "（$G$ 自伴）：由基本引理", "（见\\cref{cor:b3:lp:fundlemma}），$f = 0$ 几乎处处成立。正性：对", "连续 $f$，记 $u = Gf$，", "\\[", "\\langle f, Gf\\rangle = \\int_0^1 fu = \\int_0^1(-u'')u", "= \\bigl[-u'u\\bigr]_0^1 + \\int_0^1(u')^2 = \\int_0^1(u')^2", "\\geq 0 ;", "\\]", "对 $f \\in L^2$，在 $L^2$ 中用连续函数 $f_n$ 逼近：", "两端取极限（$G$ 有界）即可。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 若 $Gu = \\lambda u$，$\\lambda \\neq 0$：$Gu$", "连续（$\\abs{Gu(x) - Gu(x')} \\leq \\norm{g(x,\\cdot) -", "g(x',\\cdot)}_2\\norm u_2$，核一致", "连续），故 $u$ 有连续代表元；", "再由第 2 问的公式知 $Gu \\in \\mathcal C^2$，于是 $u =", "\\frac1\\lambda Gu \\in \\mathcal C^2$，且 $-\\lambda u'' =", "-(Gu)'' = u$，$u(0) = u(1) = 0$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 由 $-\\lambda u'' = u$，$u(0) = 0$，得 $u = A\\sin(x/\\sqrt", "\\lambda)$（$\\lambda$ 为正：由第 3 问，$\\lambda =", "\\langle u, Gu\\rangle/\\norm u^2 > 0$，对特征向量成立）。$u(1) =", "0$ 迫使 $\\frac1{\\sqrt\\lambda} = n\\pi$，于是 $\\lambda_n =", "\\frac1{n^2\\pi^2}$，特征函数为 $\\sin(n\\pi x)$，归一化后", "$e_n = \\sqrt2\\sin(n\\pi x)$（$\\int_0^12\\sin^2(n\\pi x)\\dd x =", "1$）。正交性验证：$2\\sin(m\\pi x)\\sin(n\\pi x) =", "\\cos((m-n)\\pi x) - \\cos((m+n)\\pi x)$ 的积分为 $0$，只要 $m", "\\neq n$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\ker G = \\{0\\}$（第 3 问），故", "由\\cref{thm:b3:spectral:spectral}(1) 得 $H =", "\\overline{\\operatorname{Vect}}(e_n)$：正弦函数构成", "$L^2(\\intcc01)$ 的希尔伯特基。对 $f(x) = x(1 - x)$：", "\\[", "c_n = \\sqrt2\\int_0^1x(1-x)\\sin(n\\pi x)\\,\\dd x", "= \\sqrt2\\;\\frac{2\\bigl(1 - (-1)^n\\bigr)}{n^3\\pi^3}", "= \\begin{cases}\\dfrac{4\\sqrt2}{n^3\\pi^3} & n \\text{ 奇数},\\\\", "0 & n \\text{ 偶数},\\end{cases}", "\\]", "（两次分部积分）。由帕塞瓦尔恒等式：$\\int_0^1x^2(1-x)^2\\dd", "x = \\frac1{30} = \\sum_{n \\text{ 奇数}}\\frac{32}{n^6\\pi^6}$，", "即 $\\sum_{n\\text{ 奇数}}n^{-6} = \\frac{\\pi^6}{960}$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $\\langle e_n, Ge_n\\rangle = \\lambda_n\\norm{e_n}^2", "= \\lambda_n$。固定 $x$，$g(x,", "\\cdot)$：$\\langle e_n, g(x,\\cdot)\\rangle = (Ge_n)(x) =", "\\lambda_ne_n(x)$，故 $g(x,\\cdot) =", "\\sum_n\\lambda_ne_n(x)\\,e_n$ 在 $L^2$ 中成立。显式级数", "$\\sum_n\\lambda_ne_n(x)e_n(y) = \\sum_n\\frac{2\\sin(n\\pi", "x)\\sin(n\\pi y)}{n^2\\pi^2}$ 在正方形上一致绝对收敛", "（$\\abs{\\text{项}} \\leq \\frac2{n^2\\pi^2}$）：其和", "连续，且对每个 $x$，它在", "$L^2(\\dd y)$ 意义下与 $g(x, \\cdot)$ 有相同的系数：两个连续", "函数对所有 $(x, y)$ 都相等。令 $y = x$，", "并积分（一致绝对收敛允许", "逐项积分）：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1g(x,x)\\,\\dd x =", "\\sum_n\\lambda_n\\int_0^1e_n(x)^2\\dd x = \\sum_n\\lambda_n .", "\\]", ""]}